    czym mog\u0119 pom\xF3c?\",\"parentUIDs\":[59],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"George\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":85}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":474.0001,\"yPos\":434.000061},\"ID\":77,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Duchy
    i magia to zabobon, a Madame Selma go krzewi. Jest artystk\u0105 sceniczn\u0105,
    kt\xF3ra wyci\u0105ga pieni\u0105dze z kiesy bogatych.\",\"parentUIDs\":[48],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"George\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":54}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":469.000031,\"yPos\":644.6669},\"ID\":79,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Poniewa\u017C,
